$f(\xk+\Qk\sk)-f(\xk)\leq 2\kappa_{ef}\dk^2+\mhatk(\sk)-\mhatk( m{0})\leq - rac{\kappa_{fcd}}{4}
ormii{\gkhat}\dk,$
where the last inequality follows from the fact that $\dk\leq  rac{\kappa_{fcd}}{8\kappa_{ef}}
